payload:string

Returns the result 

"payload":\{"string":"java.nio.HeapByteBuffer[pos=0 lim=4 cap=4]"}

We propose instead to represent the byte array as a hex string

"payload":\{"string":"FFEEDDAABB123F"}","issue":"KAFKA-12170","summary":"Connect Cast cannot deal with fields of type "bytes" correctly"}

